      "lines": [
        "31. 乘法分配律"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正负数乘法满足分配律："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于任意数$a$、$b$和$c$，等式$(a+b)c=ac+bc$成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们设$a=7$，$b=-5$，$c=-3$来验证等式$(a+b)c=ac+↵bc$.求左边的值：$(7-5)\\cdot(-3)=2\\cdot(-3)=-6$.求右边的值：",
        "$7\\cdot(-3)+(-5)\\cdot(-3)=-21+15=-6$.两边所得结果",
        "相同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
